  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Children&apos;s Christmas Calendar  (Promotion and education material), since 2021</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The purpose of the Children&apos;s Christmas Calendar is to engage children and their families in developmental issues &#x2013; in school and at home. 

The Children&apos;s Christmas Calendar will continue to expand and evolve as a key activity in the MFA&#x2019;s engagement efforts towards children and families. The aim remains to engage families in Danish Development aid and retain support for these efforts.</narrative>
